blocks a pulmonary artery, pulmonary embolism results — marked by sudden shortness of breath, worsening chest pain with deep breaths, rapid heartbeat, dizziness, and sometimes coughing up blood. In such cases, call 120 immediately. The 17.4% figure reflects mortality among confirmed pulmonary embolism cases, not the overall risk associated with leg swelling alone; don’t let this number cause undue alarm."]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["My note"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["Write a reminder for yourself…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/en/tip/13-10"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["Previous"]},"After an elderly person suffers a head injury, they may develop unsteady gait, sluggishness, excessive sleepiness, or weakness on one side of the body two to three weeks later — a CT scan is recommended"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link next","href":"/en/tip/13-12"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["Next"]},"For severe bleeding, first press firmly on the wound with your hand; if this fails on limbs, apply a tourniquet and call 120 immediately"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","stro